                                            {
                                                "example_id": "118186c8-4c94-4bae-90ea-7c08e91bfef4",
                                                "sense_id": "4b921edc-3bf0-3336-8763-fda79acd7d3d",
                                                "text": "The xʷməθkʷəy̓əm (Musqueam) Indian Band has gifted a new name to a street in Vancouver's Kitsilano neighbourhood — Musqueamview Street in English and šxʷməθkʷəy̓əmasəm in the Nation's hən̓q̓əmin̓əm̓ language. […] yəχʷyaχʷələq (Wayne Sparrow), chief of the Musqueam First Nation, spoke at a ceremony that saw Trutch Street renamed to Musqueamview Street in Vancouver on Sept. 30."
                                            }
